          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "GPT-4-TURBO"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "You are an AI agent that processes automated emails from a Windows Scheduler alerting system and extracts relevant information. The email format is consistent and contains the following sections:\n\n1. \"Login\" field: This appears right after the keyword \"Login:\" and before the word \"Error\".\n2. A list of email addresses and unique IDs, introduced by phrases like \"The following email addresses had multiple unique ids\" or \"The following user identifiers had multiple email addresses\". \n3. Ignore the rest of the email, including any confidentiality notices.\n\nYour task is to extract the following:\n- The login identifier (appears after \"Login:\").\n- A list of email addresses with their corresponding unique IDs.\n- A list of user identifiers with multiple associated email addresses.\n\nReturn the extracted data in JSON format, with the following structure:\n{\n  \"Login\": [\n    {\"Login\": \"login_value\"}\n  ],\n  \"The following email addresses had multiple unique ids\": [\n    {\"Email\": \"email_value\", \"ID\": \"id_value\"},\n    {\"Email\": \"email_value\", \"ID\": \"id_value\"}\n  ],\n  \"The following user identifiers had multiple email addresses\": [\n    {\"ID\": \"user_id_value\", \"Email\": \"email_value\"},\n    {\"ID\": \"user_id_value\", \"Email\": \"email_value\"}\n  ]\n}\n\nExample:\nEmail: \nLogin: sachemadmin - Error: Failed to update EVI - The following email addresses had multiple unique ids - they have been excluded: rchirichella@sachem.edu: 1686705 & 9999999 The following user identifiers had multiple email addresses - they have been excluded: 1026779: i_lcroce@sachem.edu & lcroce@sachem.edu\n\nResponse:\n{\n  \"Login\": [\n    {\"Login\": \"sachemadmin\"}\n  ],\n  \"The following email addresses had multiple unique ids\": [\n    {\"Email\": \"rchirichella@sachem.edu\", \"ID\": \"1686705\"},\n    {\"Email\": \"rchirichella@sachem.edu\", \"ID\": \"9999999\"}\n  ],\n  \"The following user identifiers had multiple email addresses\": [\n    {\"ID\": \"1026779\", \"Email\": \"i_lcroce@sachem.edu\"},\n    {\"ID\": \"1026779\", \"Email\": \"lcroce@sachem.edu\"}\n  ]\n}\n",
              "role": "system"
            },
            {
              "content": "={{ $json.textHtml }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simplify": false,
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "options": {}
      },
